Hi Michelle,

I've confirmed the proposed limit of 180 seats, the annual fee of USD 82,000 =
and the one-year service period from April 1, 2025 through March 31, 2026.

Please use the activation language in the attached redline: April 1 is the st=
art of the service period, and seats will be activated progressively from the=
 roster confirmed by Hollis IT. Once that language is in the order, it can pr=
oceed to signature. The 30 pilot seats are not additional to the 180-seat ord=
er limit. The order still needs both parties' execution.

Keep the earlier draft saying all 180 seats will be activated on the start da=
te internal; please don't send it to Hollis.

Thanks,
Jonathan

On March 18, 2025 at 12:24 PM, Michelle Whitaker wrote:
> The draft says to activate all 180 seats on the service start date. Can we =
change that to progressive activation from the roster confirmed by Hollis IT?=
 Lawrence and Divya will confirm the initial production roster by March 27. P=
lease let me know by 14:00 if the revised wording can proceed to signature.

